# Root-level env for the API and hero apps. Add VITE_/server vars as needed.
#
# Desktop signing keys live in `apps/desktop/.env` (loaded by
# `bun run desktop ...` from inside `apps/desktop/`).
# Apple notarization credentials live in `.env.release` (loaded only by
# `bash scripts/release-desktop.sh`) so day-to-day local builds stay fast.

# Frontend / Polar product IDs etc. (add as needed)
# VITE_POLAR_PRODUCT_PRO=
